metrics.anchor:
• Evaluation Metrics: We evaluate model performance based on three key metrics: 1) Parameters
(Params), reflecting model size and complexity; 2) GFLOPs, measuring the computational cost;
and 3) Accuracy (Acc), assessing predictive precision on the recognition task.

